<title>USA: U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</title>
<headline>U.S. mortgage application volume rose in latest wk.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The volume of U.S. mortgage applications rose 15.1 percent in the week ended January 31, according to a Mortgage Bankers Association of America weekly survey.</p>
<p>Specifically, the volume of applications to refinance mortgages rose 10.1 percent in the latest survey week, while applications to purchase mortgages rose 16.9 percent.</p>
<p>The seasonally adjusted refinancing index fell 0.9 percent to 338.4 from 341.6 the previous week.</p>
<p>The purchase index fell 1.7 percent to 176.6 in the latest survey from 179.6 in the previous week.  </p>
